WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.815
A speech needs an audience, purpose, selected facts, clear introduction, ordered

00:00:04.815 --> 00:00:06.493
points and effective conclusion.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:12.423
Which sentence is a topic sentence? Answer: Our school garden needs regular care.

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:17.763
Present a one-minute speech about reading habits with an opening, two facts and a

00:00:17.763 --> 00:00:18.083
closing.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:23.238
Discuss why: A topic sentence introduces the paragraph's main point.
